<title>USA: AirNet to acquire Float Control Inc.</title>
<headline>AirNet to acquire Float Control Inc.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>AirNet Systems Inc said on Wednesday it intended to acquire Float Control Inc for an estimated $2.85 million in AirNet common stock.</p>
<p>The transaction is scheduled for closing within several weeks and marks the second acquisition annoucement for AirNet Systems in as many months.</p>
<p>Float Control Inc, a company owned by certain executive officers of AirNet as well as other people, owns a 19 percent interest in the Checking Exchange System.</p>
